{"id":371,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><h1><strong>4月23日</strong><strong>物联网工程专业</strong><strong>成功举办</strong><strong>青年教师</strong><strong>教学</strong><strong>基本功大赛</strong><strong>，</strong><strong>本次大赛以</strong><strong>“</strong><strong>夯实教学基本功，提升育人真本领</strong><strong>”</strong><strong>为主题，旨在为青年教师搭建展示自我、交流互鉴的平台，营造</strong><strong>“</strong><strong>比学赶超</strong><strong>”</strong><strong>的良好教学氛围。</strong></h1><h1><strong>大赛由</strong><strong>梁志剑副院长列席指导，</strong><strong>武瑞娟、贾志燕、王丽芳三位老师担任评委，</strong><strong>大赛设置</strong><strong>教学设计、教学展示、教学反思</strong><strong>三个核心环节，全面考察青年教师的教学设计能力、课堂驾驭能力及教学反思能力。</strong><strong>经过激烈角逐</strong><strong>，</strong><strong>大赛最终评选出</strong><strong>：</strong><strong>翟双姣、庞淑蓉、李菲三位老师参加院赛。</strong></h1><h1><strong>本次大赛</strong><strong>是</strong><strong>加</strong><strong>强师资队伍建设、深化教育教学改革的重要举措</strong><strong>，</strong><strong>物联网</strong><strong>工程</strong><strong>专业</strong><strong>将以此次大赛为契机，进一步完善青年教师培养体系</strong><strong>，</strong><strong>更好</strong><strong>助力我校的“双一流”建设。</strong></h1><p><strong><br></strong></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=GU8Qf2MNnkLmGPUkl-sozL8LzC4L49RbnmA2L4l8L7WRUzL0gihFp2hmCIa0LSybL1yYnkhkLlL8nlM2MlLiLzVkLRVVoRVfU4CiLRCbnzQFoR7PnmvYoRrFL4A2M4-Jv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLz-0Lz7DLmLJqd7nx&oid=1391370217&tid=1112&nid=11623&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/1922DB1C4ECF5C511B01E81AC65069E6/811F7285/38F72\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=GU8Qf2MNnkLmGPUkl-sozL8LzC4L49RbnmA2L4l8L7WRUzL0gihFp2hmCIa0LSybL1yYnkhkLlL8nlM2MlLiLzVkLRVVoRVfU4CiLRCbnzQFoR7PnmvYoRrFL4A2M4-Jv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLz-0Lz7DLmLJqd7nx&oid=1391370217&tid=1112&nid=11623&e=.png\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=GLR-fbM4lPoRGYMkmUYL7-sU4-8nmrRfMmNiMlrfLmLPMmU0gihFp2hmCIa0USysUYybLSy8MmNin7rRnzlDozV7Mm7PLR6Rn7Q7LlLDLNQFLRlbMR-bMzVFL4QRU8-Jv2bjo4OeoDM46khXptQ0g47PLz-0Lz7DLmLJqd7nx&oid=1391370217&tid=1112&nid=11623&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/A7C914695DECE5691D61107CDFD1C62F/05942951/36CCB\" vheight